sequenceDiagram
    participant YOLO as YOLOv8 (yolov8n-face.pt)
    participant Pre as Preprocessing
    participant FN as FaceNet (keras-facenet)
    participant SVM as SVC (new_classifier_Jun27_759.pkl)

    YOLO->>Pre: Bounding box coordinates (x1, y1, x2, y2)
    Pre->>Pre: face_img = frame[y1:y2, x1:x2]
    Pre->>Pre: cv2.resize(face_img, (160, 160))
    Pre->>FN: Pass 160x160 RGB array
    
    FN->>FN: embedder.embeddings()
    FN->>SVM: Pass 1x512 embedding vector
    
    SVM->>SVM: model.predict_proba(embedding)
    SVM->>SVM: model.predict(embedding)
    
    SVM-->>YOLO: Returns (Name, Probability) back to application loop
